e Language of Heaven - Molly Kiefer","description":null,"speaker_slug":"molly-kiefer","series_slug":"live-your-best-life-for-the-rest-of-your-life","scripture_references":["1 Corinthians 14:14-15","1 Corinthians 14:18-19","1 Corinthians 14:2-5","Romans 8:26"],"topics":["Build Up Your Faith","Intimacy with God","Prayer","Prayer Language","Strengthen Your Faith"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":null,"youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xa51cwzf2WQ?si=mmDPfGgvnybpJhs_&start=2799","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xa51cwzf2WQ?si=mmDPfGgvnybpJhs_&start=2799","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-10-18","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":null,"published_at":"2024-10-18T13:59:45-05:00"},{"slug":"word-on-the-street-prophecy-in-action-molly-kiefer","title":"Word on the Street:  Prophecy in Action - Molly Kiefer","description":null,"speaker_slug":"molly-kiefer","series_slug":"live-your-best-life-for-the-rest-of-your-life","scripture_references":["1 Corinthians 14:1","1 Corinthians 14:3","1 Thessalonians 5:20","1 Timothy 1:18-19"],"topics":["God's Promise","God's Voice","Hearing God","Promises","Prophecy","Prophetic Gifts","Spiritual Gifts"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/sermons/2024/10/1013-LYBL3.mp3","youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/W7RXLhyIEzE?si=VauRnOVsOMpKRc20","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/W7RXLhyIEzE?si=VauRnOVsOMpKRc20","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-10-15","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":null,"published_at":"2024-10-15T21:36:58-05:00"},{"slug":"more-than-a-song-reigniting-your-passion-for-worship-kevin-kiefer","title":"More Than a Song: Reigniting Your Passion for Worship - Kevin Kiefer","description":"Do you sometimes feel like Sunday worship has become just another routine? Sunday morning worship is a powerful opportunity to encounter God, but how often do we come unprepared or distracted? In this message, we’ll explore how to get the most out of our worship by preparing our hearts, minds, and spirits in advance. From eliminating distractions to setting expectations for encountering God, we’ll discover practical steps to engage deeply and experience His presence in a transformative way. Worship isn’t just about showing up — it’s about showing up ready to meet with God. Let’s learn how to be fully present and open to what He wants to do in our lives each Sunday.","speaker_slug":"kevin-kiefer","series_slug":"live-your-best-life-for-the-rest-of-your-life","scripture_references":[],"topics":["Distractions","Encountering God","God's Presence","Preparation","Spiritual Engagement","Transformation","Transformative Worship","Worship"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/sermons/2024/09/LYBL1-smaller.mp3","youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ns6CvMAeWPs?si=7j5kHYuNAus3bQsB&start=565","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ns6CvMAeWPs?si=7j5kHYuNAus3bQsB&start=565","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-09-26","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"Do you sometimes feel like Sunday worship has become just another routine? Sunday morning worship is a powerful opportunity to encounter God, but how often do w","published_at":"2024-09-26T09:54:48-05:00"},{"slug":"from-routine-to-revival-transforming-your-worship-kevin-kiefer","title":"From Routine to Revival: Transforming Your Worship - Kevin Kiefer","description":"Do you ever feel stuck in your worship, longing for something deeper? You’re not alone. Many of us desire to experience God more powerfully but struggle to break free from routine. This Sunday, discover practical ways to move from going through the motions to encountering God’s presence in a fresh and transformative way. Learn how growing as a worshipper can ignite joy, deepen your relationship with Him, and invite His blessings into every area of your life!","speaker_slug":"kevin-kiefer","series_slug":"study-with-the-savior","scripture_references":[],"topics":["Break Free from Routine","Encountering God","Faith","God's Presence","Joy","Renewed Faith","Revival","Spiritual Growth","Worship"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/sermons/2024/09/SwtS3-smaller.mp3","youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nyTssaeOp-s?si=26bW9rXE2p5fT1tG&start=2715","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nyTssaeOp-s?si=26bW9rXE2p5fT1tG&start=2715","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-09-16","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"Do you ever feel stuck in your worship, longing for something deeper? You’re not alone. Many of us desire to experience God more powerfully but struggle to brea","published_at":"2024-09-16T17:19:17-05:00"},{"slug":"forgiveness-the-freedom-you-didnt-know-you-needed-kevin-kiefer","title":"Forgiveness: The Freedom You Didn&#039;t Know You Needed - Kevin Kiefer","description":"Ever feel weighed down by grudges or past hurts? In this week's sermon, we'll explore how Jesus' teachings on forgiveness offer a surprising and powerful path to true freedom. Discover why letting go isn’t just about others—it’s about unlocking a new level of peace and joy in your own life. Join us as we dive into the transformative power of forgiveness and learn how to embrace the freedom you didn’t even know you needed!","speaker_slug":"kevin-kiefer","series_slug":"study-with-the-savior","scripture_references":["Matthew 18"],"topics":["Forgiveness","Freedom","Healing","Jesus' Teachings","Joy","Matthew 18","Peace","Spiritual Freedom","Spiritual Growth","Transformation"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/sermons/2024/09/Forgiveness-The-Freedom-You-Didnt-Know-You-Needed.mp3","youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/g1na4A10RCY?si=MV5JSduxy1AHbNVe","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/g1na4A10RCY?si=MV5JSduxy1AHbNVe","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-09-10","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"Ever feel weighed down by grudges or past hurts? In this week's sermon, we'll explore how Jesus' teachings on forgiveness offer a surprising and powerful path t","published_at":"2024-09-10T13:22:34-05:00"},{"slug":"what-we-can-learn-from-jesus-molly-kiefer","title":"What We Can Learn from Jesus - Molly Kiefer","description":"Have you ever felt like you don't have the words to pray? Need a boost in your prayer life? Jesus answered the disciples' request for the one lesson they had to know: \"Teach us to pray in power, like you pray.\" Follow along with the details of this lesson and let Jesus' instruction transform your daily life.","speaker_slug":"molly-kiefer","series_slug":"study-with-the-savior","scripture_references":["Luke 11:1","Matthew 6:9-10"],"topics":["Forgiveness","Praise","Prayer","Trials"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/sermons/2024/09/SwtS2-smaller.mp3","youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jkue5OEMQsw?si=6WmbX4Izv61MrHfY","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jkue5OEMQsw?si=6WmbX4Izv61MrHfY","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-09-09","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"Have you ever felt like you don't have the words to pray? Need a boost in your prayer life? Jesus answered the disciples' request for the one lesson they had to","published_at":"2024-09-09T19:22:59-05:00"},{"slug":"mediterranean-messages-philippians-molly-kiefer","title":"Mediterranean Messages: Philippians - Molly Kiefer","description":"Are you feeling overwhelmed by the complexities of life? Is it possible to live with less anxiety as life gets more intense? This message, our last stop through the Mediterranean, we learn antidotes for anxiety straight from the Paul's heartfelt letter to the Philippians. Discover how Paul's words, written from a Roman prison, offer timeless wisdom and practical steps to transform your worries into peace.","speaker_slug":"molly-kiefer","series_slug":"mediterranean-messages","scripture_references":["Philippians 4:4-8"],"topics":["Anxiety","Fear","Peace","Stress","Worry"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":null,"youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/S-73hjE8iUs?si=7HUQrpCEtKGRYZao&start=2594","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/S-73hjE8iUs?si=7HUQrpCEtKGRYZao&start=2594","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-08-11","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"Are you feeling overwhelmed by the complexities of life? Is it possible to live with less anxiety as life gets more intense? This message, our last stop through","published_at":"2024-08-11T11:51:06-05:00"},{"slug":"all-for-one-and-one-for-all-kevin-kiefer","title":"Mediterranean Messages: Corinthians - Kevin Kiefer","description":"Why is unity within the church so hard? It just is! But disunity in the church makes church a terrible place to be, which is why the Apostle Paul focused on building unity within the church in nearly all of his letters. This week we learn about the most powerful antidote to disunity within the church (or family, workplace, school, etc.) and how we can enjoy the blessing of unity in our lives!","speaker_slug":"kevin-kiefer","series_slug":"mediterranean-messages","scripture_references":["1 Corinthians 1","1 Corinthians 13","Colossians 3","Ephesians 4"],"topics":["Fellowship","Humility","Peace","Politics","Pride","Relationships","Unity"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":null,"youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/G4X2a75DK-Y?si=mJSd9L84Aphaffa1&start=2630","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/G4X2a75DK-Y?si=mJSd9L84Aphaffa1&start=2630","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-08-11","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"Why is unity within the church so hard? It just is! But disunity in the church makes church a terrible place to be, which is why the Apostle Paul focused on bui","published_at":"2024-08-11T11:58:23-05:00"},{"slug":"mediterranean-messages-romans-kevin-kiefer","title":"Mediterranean Messages: Romans - Kevin Kiefer","description":"Are we Christians \"sinners, saved by grace\"? It's an important question that Paul wrestles with in the book of Romans. Join us as we discover our true identity in Christ, and what it means to live out our new, sanctified life!","speaker_slug":"kevin-kiefer","series_slug":"mediterranean-messages","scripture_references":["Romans 12","Romans 5","Romans 8"],"topics":["Grace","Growth","Identity","Obedience","Sanctification"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":null,"youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kHyJ5-V99gw?si=8zcCLBh8QSG0f-8p&start=2249","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kHyJ5-V99gw?si=8zcCLBh8QSG0f-8p&start=2249","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-08-07","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"Are we Christians \"sinners, saved by grace\"? It's an important question that Paul wrestles with in the book of Romans. Join us as we discover our true identity ","published_at":"2024-08-07T00:52:46-05:00"},{"slug":"finding-kingdom-riches-in-spiritual-poverty-kevin-kiefer","title":"Finding Kingdom Riches in Spiritual Poverty - Kevin Kiefer","description":"In a world where no one wants to be poor, Jesus' teaching in the Sermon on the Mount stands as a radical, countercultural message. As we conclude our \"More Like Jesus\" series, we'll explore how Jesus' Beatitudes, particularly \"Blessed are the poor in spirit,\" redefine true richness and happiness. Join us as we uncover the profound blessings that come from spiritual emptiness and dependence on God, leading us to the fullness of His Kingdom.","speaker_slug":"kevin-kiefer","series_slug":"more-like-jesus","scripture_references":["Luke 18:9","Matthew 5:20","Matthew 5:3"],"topics":["Blessing","Faith","Poor in Spirit","Poverty","Riches","Trust"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":null,"youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bg1Gj6gvnbM?si=aKXqjli18mJUUqkF&start=2289","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bg1Gj6gvnbM?si=aKXqjli18mJUUqkF&start=2289","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-07-24","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"In a world where no one wants to be poor, Jesus' teaching in the Sermon on the Mount stands as a radical, countercultural message. As we conclude our \"More Like","published_at":"2024-07-24T16:21:02-05:00"},{"slug":"daring-decisions-molly-kiefer","title":"Daring Decisions - Molly Kiefer","description":"Are you tired of your good intentions falling short? Feeling like your resolve fades by the end of January? In our latest sermon, we dive deep into how Daniel, living under intense pressure to conform in Babylon, made resolute decisions to honor God. Join us to learn how his unwavering commitment to prayer and presence helped him stay true to his values and how you can apply these principles to live a life without regrets. Discover the secret to making lasting, impactful decisions that align with your deepest convictions.","speaker_slug":"molly-kiefer","series_slug":"on-your-mark-get-set-go","scripture_references":["2 Chronicles 6:36-40","Daniel 1","Daniel 6:10-11"],"topics":["Decision Making","Good Decisions","Prayer Life","Preparation in Prayer","Prepared by God"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":null,"youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SJDUikm3KiY?si=oqogq_TVLULHjqM4&start=3409","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SJDUikm3KiY?si=oqogq_TVLULHjqM4&start=3409","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-07-23","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"Are you tired of your good intentions falling short? Feeling like your resolve fades by the end of January? In our latest sermon, we dive deep into how Daniel, ","published_at":"2024-07-23T16:47:37-05:00"},{"slug":"the-joy-of-purposeful-stewardship-kevin-kiefer","title":"Passing the Stewardship Test - Kevin Kiefer","description":"Are you faithful? Hmmm... Faithfulness to God might be hard to measure, but stewardship is one great way to measure faithfulness. In this sermon, you will be challenged to reflect on your use of time, talents, and treasures. Are you investing what God has given you wisely? Discover how Jesus calls us to be faithful stewards, promising greater responsibility and eternal rewards for our faithfulness.","speaker_slug":"kevin-kiefer","series_slug":"more-like-jesus","scripture_references":["2 Corinthians","Genesis 22","Job 1:2","Judges 6:8","Luke 19:11-27"],"topics":["Abraham","Compassion","Eternal Reward","Faith","Faithfulness","Fruitful Stewardship","Generous Giving","God's Work","Investments","Matthew","Money","New Earth","New Heaven","Parable","Prayer","Productivity","Purpose","Regrets","Responsibility","Stewardship","Talents","Time","Treasures","Trust"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/sermons/2024/07/421-Kevin-MLJ3.mp3","youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CZtzh_rYZVY?si=JdO_sAL9BCG9u1Cr&start=2789","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CZtzh_rYZVY?si=JdO_sAL9BCG9u1Cr&start=2789","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-07-22","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"Are you faithful? Hmmm... Faithfulness to God might be hard to measure, but stewardship is one great way to measure faithfulness. In this sermon, you will be ch","published_at":"2024-07-22T17:59:34-05:00"},{"slug":"mediterranean-messages-colossians","title":"Mediterranean Messages: Colossians - Molly Kiefer","description":"If you're feeling overwhelmed by life's puzzle pieces or clouded by negativity, Paul's letter to the Colossians provides clarity, hope, and a powerful reminder of Jesus' ultimate authority and victory over all spiritual forces. Paul’s words remind us who is really in charge in the affairs of our day. We must remember the final outcome. This is the advantage we need to live in victory for today’s battles.","speaker_slug":"molly-kiefer","series_slug":"mediterranean-messages","scripture_references":["Colossians 1:15-20","Colossians 2:9-15","Revelation 12: 10-11"],"topics":["Authority","Deliverance","Fight Deception","Hardship","Overcome Evil","Power","Spiritual Authority","Spiritual Warfare","Victory","Word of Testimony"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":null,"youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/STCsxXt63Iw?si=MZNkDMlzVO37Znh_&start=3054","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/STCsxXt63Iw?si=MZNkDMlzVO37Znh_&start=3054","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-07-21","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"If you're feeling overwhelmed by life's puzzle pieces or clouded by negativity, Paul's letter to the Colossians provides clarity, hope, and a powerful reminder ","published_at":"2024-07-21T18:30:52-05:00"},{"slug":"josephs-technicolor-victory-molly-kiefer","title":"Joseph&#039;s Technicolor Victory - Molly Kiefer","description":"There is a common obstacle we will all face on our journey toward Kingdom impact. There is a pitfall that will catch up us and keep us from the heights we were designed for. There is a skill we all need to help secure a flourishing future for our family and loved ones. Learn from Joseph how to go from black and blue victim to amazing technicolor victory!","speaker_slug":"molly-kiefer","series_slug":"genesis-rewind","scripture_references":["Genesis 37","Genesis 45:7"],"topics":["Betrayal","Bitterness","Blessing","Overcome Pain","Overcome Setbacks","Potential"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":null,"youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QTpfRCFlAL0?si=bCDM98m2gH9iwfRl&start=3151","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QTpfRCFlAL0?si=bCDM98m2gH9iwfRl&start=3151","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-07-21","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"There is a common obstacle we will all face on our journey toward Kingdom impact. There is a pitfall that will catch up us and keep us from the heights we were ","published_at":"2024-07-21T18:39:26-05:00"},{"slug":"the-greatest-comeback","title":"The Greatest Comeback","description":"Discover how focusing on knowing Christ and His resurrection power can transform your perspective, bringing clarity and peace in every situation. Tune in to learn how to live with assurance and purpose, free from doubt and regret. \u00a0In all our second-guessing, Paul’s words bring confidence that we are choosing the best.","speaker_slug":"molly-kiefer","series_slug":"easter-sunday","scripture_references":["Ephesians 1:19-20","Matthew 13:44","Philippians 3:10"],"topics":["chose right","Know Christ","Power of Resurrection"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":null,"youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SjrHeCT4DtM?si=x8Ooyb5xWUxt3YTN&start=2964","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SjrHeCT4DtM?si=x8Ooyb5xWUxt3YTN&start=2964","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-07-19","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"Discover how focusing on knowing Christ and His resurrection power can transform your perspective, bringing clarity and peace in every situation. Tune in to lea","published_at":"2024-07-19T19:18:45-05:00"},{"slug":"mediterranean-messages-thessalonians-molly-kiefer","title":"Mediterranean Messages: Thessalonians - Molly Kiefer","description":"Are you searching for guidance, hope, and a fresh perspective on life’s challenges? Paul’s letters to the Thessalonians, will impact, challenge and encourage you. Dive into their world, where confusion and questions abounded, and discover how Paul’s teachings on standing firm in faith are just as relevant today. With topics ranging from sexual integrity to enduring hope in trying times, this sermon promises to inspire and equip you for a life that honors Jesus as Lord. Join us and see how Paul's ancient wisdom can bring clarity and strength to your life today!\n\nListen to the podcast here!","speaker_slug":"molly-kiefer","series_slug":"mediterranean-messages","scripture_references":["1 Thessalonians","Philippians"],"topics":["Divine Guidance","God's Will","Holiness","Holy Spirit","Honor","Idol Worship","Jesus' Return","Paul's Letter","Purity","Sexual Purity","Sexuality","Sovereignty","Surrender","Trust"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/sermons/2024/07/06.23.24-Mediterranean-Messages-Thessalonica.mp3","youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9qpmxk5yGUo?si=3aSXBWO1118T8eD7&start=1656","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9qpmxk5yGUo?si=3aSXBWO1118T8eD7&start=1656","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-07-16","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"Are you searching for guidance, hope, and a fresh perspective on life’s challenges? Paul’s letters to the Thessalonians, will impact, challenge and encourage yo","published_at":"2024-07-16T22:07:31-05:00"},{"slug":"living-the-parable-of-the-good-samaritan-kevin-kiefer","title":"Living the Parable of the Good Samaritan - Kevin Kiefer","description":"Have you ever been unexpectedly touched by an act of kindness?\n\nIn this week's episode of Thrive Vineyard Church Sermon of the Week, we embark on a journey through the parable of the Good Samaritan. Pastor Kevin draws insightful parallels between this timeless story and our modern lives, urging us to recognize and respond to the brokenness around us. Be prepared to rethink your own capacity for compassion and sacrifice as we examine the importance of loving our neighbors, regardless of the personal cost involved.\n\nJoin us on this transformative journey to not only learn about, but to also start living out the sacrificial, compassionate love that truly marks us as followers of Christ.","speaker_slug":"kevin-kiefer","series_slug":"more-like-jesus","scripture_references":["Luke 10"],"topics":["Compassion","Good Samaritan","Healing","Jesus Christ","Kingdom Life","Love One Another","Parable","Persistent Prayer","Sacrifice","Unconditional Love"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/sermons/2024/07/4.7-MLJ-1-Kevin-71624-9.39-PM.mp3","youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/X_HziFlDoG4?si=2iO2OIzGQrjuWDJm&start=2931","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/X_HziFlDoG4?si=2iO2OIzGQrjuWDJm&start=2931","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-07-16","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"Have you ever been unexpectedly touched by an act of kindness? In this week's episode of Thrive Vineyard Church Sermon of the Week, we embark on a journey throu","published_at":"2024-07-16T22:52:58-05:00"},{"slug":"journey-to-the-heart-of-prayer-molly-kiefer","title":"Pray like Jesus - Molly Kiefer","description":"Do you ever wonder if your prayer life is all it could be?\u00a0 Will you ever graduate past Kindergartener level of prayer?\u00a0 Is there a secret to prayer that you just haven’t discovered yet?\u00a0 This week’s message moves your prayer from routine to robust. Discover how to move beyond the performance of prayer and into a genuine, intimate connection with God. Let's learn how prayer can transform us, not just in the moment, but in our everyday lives.","speaker_slug":"molly-kiefer","series_slug":"more-like-jesus","scripture_references":["2 Corinthians 3:18","Exodus 33:9-11","Matthew 6:5-6","Philippians 4:6-7","Psalm 145:8","Psalm 16:11"],"topics":["Abundance","Courage","Distractions","Divine Provision","Faith","God's Presence","Grace","Intimacy with God","Jesus","Neuroscience","Prayer","Renewal","Transformation","Worship"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/sermons/2024/07/4.14-MLJ-2-Molly.mp3","youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/iEoU29HMvec?si=rGanrKbQ-jXgtaPL&start=3069","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/iEoU29HMvec?si=rGanrKbQ-jXgtaPL&start=3069","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-07-16","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"Do you ever wonder if your prayer life is all it could be? Will you ever graduate past Kindergartener level of prayer? Is there a secret to prayer that you just","published_at":"2024-07-16T23:35:13-05:00"},{"slug":"mediterranean-messages-galatians-molly-kiefer","title":"Mediterranean Messages: Galatians - Molly Kiefer","description":"Is self-help getting you the life you want?\u00a0 Feeling stuck and wondering if your best effort can really produce the results you hope for?\nOur culture idolizes self-improvement and hustle. But Paul’s message cuts through this noise: only by surrendering to Christ, allowing Him to live through us, can we experience true freedom and transformation.\nThis sermon invites you to reframe your life’s narrative, making Jesus the central character. Are you ready to shift your perspective, relinquish control, and live a life of unshakeable faith? Dive into Galatians and discover the liberating power of the Gospel.","speaker_slug":"molly-kiefer","series_slug":"mediterranean-messages","scripture_references":[],"topics":["Burdens","Control","Doubt","Equality","Faith","Freedom","Fruits of the Spirit","Galatia","Genuine","Grace","Guilt","Jesus","Legacy","Modern Struggles","Obedience","Paul","Religious Customs","Salvation","Spiritual Freedom","Trust","Unity"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/sermons/2024/07/71424-Molly-Galatians.mp3","youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/q6OsSv_-kAo?si=VM_w63LhL9QfWQy-&start=3284","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/q6OsSv_-kAo?si=VM_w63LhL9QfWQy-&start=3284","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-07-16","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"Is self-help getting you the life you want? Feeling stuck and wondering if your best effort can really produce the results you hope for? Our culture idolizes se","published_at":"2024-07-16T23:55:18-05:00"},{"slug":"hope-riches-and-power-appropriating-pauls-prayer-for-the-church","title":"Mediterranean Messages: Ephesians - Kevin Kiefer","description":"Join us this Sunday in our Mediterranean Messages sermon series as we make our stop in ancient Ephesus where Paul offers a powerful prayer for the believers in Ephesus and beyond. In his passionate prayer, Paul prays for a deeper knowledge of God, spiritual revelation, and a profound understanding of the hope, riches, and power available to us in Christ. Together, we will discover how to bring these powerful truths to life in our own journeys of faith, transforming Paul's prayers into our everyday reality.","speaker_slug":"kevin-kiefer","series_slug":"mediterranean-messages","scripture_references":["Ephesians 1","Ephesians 3","Isaiah 49","Romans 8"],"topics":["Believers","Church","Ephesians","Eyes of Your Heart","God's Power","Holy Spirit","Hope","Inheritance","Paul's Letter","Revelation","Transformative Power","Wisdom"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/sermons/2024/07/7.7.24-Kevin-Kiefer.mp3","youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qEd4S61sPgU?si=_CmI9xBRg4Qqy_LX&start=2737","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qEd4S61sPgU?si=_CmI9xBRg4Qqy_LX&start=2737","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-07-12","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"Join us this Sunday in our Mediterranean Messages sermon series as we make our stop in ancient Ephesus where Paul offers a powerful prayer for the believers in ","published_at":"2024-07-12T23:20:22-05:00"},{"slug":"be-filled-a-pentecost-sermon-kevin-kiefer","title":"Be Filled: A Pentecost Sermon - Kevin Kiefer","description":"Have you ever felt a longing for a deeper connection with God?\n\nThis Pentecost Sunday, join us as we explore the transformative power of the Holy Spirit.\n\nPastor Kevin dives into the thrilling account of Pentecost from Acts 2, revealing a pivotal shift. Discover the impact of how God's presence moved from a physical location inside the temple to reside within believers themselves, ready to empower and transform us.\n\nImagine living a life overflowing with God's love, radiating joy, and impacting the world around you. This sermon unpacks the key to unlocking this reality – the infilling of the Holy Spirit.","speaker_slug":"kevin-kiefer","series_slug":"empowered","scripture_references":["Acts 1","Acts 2","Ephesians 5","Galatians 5","Joel 2"],"topics":["Belief","Empowerment","Freedom","God's Presence","Holy Spirit","Identity","Pentecost","Personal Journey","Transformation"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/sermons/2024/06/05.19.24-Empowered-Week-One.mp3","youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/v06V4l-6Ux0?si=nbiKym3RnINU7Epk&start=2817","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/v06V4l-6Ux0?si=nbiKym3RnINU7Epk&start=2817","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-06-20","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"Have you ever felt a longing for a deeper connection with God? This Pentecost Sunday, join us as we explore the transformative power of the Holy Spirit. Pastor ","published_at":"2024-06-20T21:04:40-05:00"},{"slug":"the-power-of-spiritual-gifts-in-building-community-wendy-seidman","title":"The Power of Spiritual Gifts in Building Community - Wendy Seidman","description":"Feeling like a puzzle piece searching for its place within the bigger picture? This week, we delve into the beautiful tapestry of spiritual gifts!\n\nRemember the story of the early Church, a fledgling community brimming with potential but lacking direction? Today, we unlock the secret weapon gifted by the Holy Spirit – the unique talents He bestows on each believer.\n\nJoin us as we explore 1 Corinthians 12, where the Apostle Paul unveils this extraordinary truth. Discover the spectrum of gifts, from the fiery passion of encouragement to the steady hand of service.\n\nImagine using your God-given skills to not only enrich your own faith, but to build up the entire body of Christ! This sermon equips you to identify your gift and unleash its potential, fostering a thriving and impactful faith community.\n\nDon't miss this chance to discover the unique role you were created to play!","speaker_slug":"wendy-seidman","series_slug":"empowered","scripture_references":["1 Corinthians 12","Ephesians 4"],"topics":["Administration","Body of Christ","Church","Community","Diversity","Holy Spirit","Hospitality","Love","Spiritual Gifts","Teaching"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/sermons/2024/06/05.26.24-Empowered-Week-Two.mp3","youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/p6Rduebusqo?si=NU-HZ07rPMMk0Pim&start=2496","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/p6Rduebusqo?si=NU-HZ07rPMMk0Pim&start=2496","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-06-20","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"Feeling like a puzzle piece searching for its place within the bigger picture? This week, we delve into the beautiful tapestry of spiritual gifts! Remember the ","published_at":"2024-06-20T21:16:25-05:00"},{"slug":"restored-by-his-reign-experience-the-healing-power-of-gods-kingdom","title":"Restored by His Reign - Kevin Kiefer","description":"This week, Pastor Kevin grapples with the concept of living in the \"now and not yet\" of the Kingdom of God. \u00a0How do we live as conduits of God's Kingdom while making peace with the reality that God doesn't always act the way that we expect Him to?\nThe sermon concludes with a challenge to cultivate faith and live as active agents in bringing about God's will. Join us this Sunday as we are challenged to cultivate faith and embrace the tension of the now and not yet, trusting in God's ultimate plan while actively fighting for healing and transformation in the present.","speaker_slug":"kevin-kiefer","series_slug":"empowered","scripture_references":["1 Corinthians 13","1 Peter 2","2 Timothy 4","Galatians 4","Hebrews 9","Isaiah 53"],"topics":["Biblical Context","Blueprint Worldview","Faith","God's Kingdom","Healing","Jesus' Ministry","Sickness","Sin","Warfare Worldview"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/sermons/2024/06/06.02.24-Empowered-Week-Three.mp3","youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/N8RofzFOk98?si=4JiV7pPJ-NgHa9TJ&start=3189","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/N8RofzFOk98?si=4JiV7pPJ-NgHa9TJ&start=3189","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-06-10","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"This week, Pastor Kevin grapples with the concept of living in the \"now and not yet\" of the Kingdom of God. How do we live as conduits of God's Kingdom while ma","published_at":"2024-06-10T16:38:56-05:00"},{"slug":"how-to-build-a-boat-molly-kiefer","title":"How to Build a Boat - Molly Kiefer","description":"Pastor Molly Kiefer uses the universally relatable experience of being unprepared for a big event to illustrate divine preparation in our spiritual lives. Through the story of Noah in Genesis 6, she shows how Noah’s faithfulness and close walk with God equipped him for his monumental task. Pastor Molly emphasizes the importance of being attuned to God’s voice, sharing a personal story of prayer and gratitude that led to an unexpected discovery. Reflecting on Noah’s immediate and humble obedience, she encourages us to reignite our commitment to God’s kingdom, focusing on His plans for redemption and restoration. This message is a stirring call to embrace urgent obedience and a humble walk with God.","speaker_slug":"molly-kiefer","series_slug":"genesis-rewind","scripture_references":["Genesis 6-9"],"topics":["Breakthrough","Building God's Kingdom","Divine Guidance","Divine Wisdom","Faith","Future Preparation","Holy Spirit","Noah","Obedience","Redemption","Restoration","Spiritual Practices","Walking with God"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/sermons/2024/05/02.18.24-How-to-Build-a-Boat.mp3","youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SB6fp5Vcyp0?si=Eg4WWhzROxeh91jM&start=3260","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SB6fp5Vcyp0?si=Eg4WWhzROxeh91jM&start=3260","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-05-28","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"Pastor Molly Kiefer uses the universally relatable experience of being unprepared for a big event to illustrate divine preparation in our spiritual lives. Throu","published_at":"2024-05-28T14:48:30-05:00"},{"slug":"talking-snakes-and-faulty-fruit","title":"Talking Snakes and Faulty Fruit - Molly Kiefer","description":"Genesis 3 is a pivot point for all humanity.\nJoin us this Sunday to avoid traps that trick us.\n\nIn this series we will dig into the stories that shape our human experience. We will find God's purposes for humanity, hope for our despair, resilience in adversity and promises that spark our endurance.","speaker_slug":"molly-kiefer","series_slug":"genesis-rewind","scripture_references":["Genesis 3"],"topics":["Blessings","Eden","Faith","Freedom","God's Goodness","Gratitude","Limitations","Obedience","Providence","Renewal","Satan","Sin","Temptation","Trust"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/sermons/2024/05/02.12.24-Talking-Snakes-Faulty-Fruit.mp3","youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/AhwBcH49Rg0?si=NZYAY4hNwFmwwJoD","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/AhwBcH49Rg0?si=NZYAY4hNwFmwwJoD","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-05-28","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"Genesis 3 is a pivot point for all humanity. Join us this Sunday to avoid traps that trick us. In this series we will dig into the stories that shape our human ","published_at":"2024-05-28T15:45:03-05:00"},{"slug":"bound-by-promise-kevin-kiefer","title":"Bound By Promise - Kevin Kiefer","description":"We don't use the word \"covenant\" much any more, but could our ignorance of the concept of covenant cause us to miss out on a deeper relationship with God? \u00a0Join us this Sunday as Kevin shares the incredible story of how God bound Himself to his people in covenant relationship. \u00a0 Drawing from the story of Abraham, in this sermon you will be challenged and inspired to live a more devoted life to God as you discover the fullness of His devotion to you!\n\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;","speaker_slug":"kevin-kiefer","series_slug":"genesis-rewind","scripture_references":["Genesis 1-3","Genesis 11","Genesis 27","Genesis 6-9"],"topics":["Abraham","Covenant","Covenant Relationship","Devotion","Faith","Faithfulness","God's Plan","Holy Spirit","Humanity","Humility","Mercy","Obedience","Pride","Redemption","Relationship with God","Repentance","Sin","Surrender","Temptations","Tower of Babel"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/sermons/2024/05/02.20.24-Bound-By-Promise.mp3","youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/29V-RJ8Wz3A?si=gXJQRHGGXhyIzcKd","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/29V-RJ8Wz3A?si=gXJQRHGGXhyIzcKd","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-05-19","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"We don't use the word \"covenant\" much any more, but could our ignorance of the concept of covenant cause us to miss out on a deeper relationship with God? Join ","published_at":"2024-05-19T13:38:18-05:00"},{"slug":"in-the-grip-of-god","title":"In the Grip of God - Kevin Kiefer","description":"In the book of Genesis, we meet Jacob. Jacob was Isaac's son, and as we hear his story, we discover that Jacob was a person who struggled to trust God. When Jacob had a need, he worked hard to get what he wanted, even if that meant manipulating or hurting others so that he could get ahead. In this sermon, Kevin shows us how sometimes when we ask God for help, God chooses instead to give us something far greater than what we asked for. But HOW God works blessing into our lives may surprise us!","speaker_slug":"kevin-kiefer","series_slug":"genesis-rewind","scripture_references":["Genesis 25","Genesis 27","Genesis 31","Genesis 32"],"topics":["Jacob's Struggles","Surrender and Transformation","Wrestling with God"],"service_type":"Sunday Service","audio_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/sermons/2024/04/03.10.24-In-the-Grip-of-God.mp3","youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Q2kL_BNwMFQ?si=ZZoz4L9nhchUhdes&start=2808","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Q2kL_BNwMFQ?si=ZZoz4L9nhchUhdes&start=2808","thumbnail_url":null,"preached_at":"2024-03-10","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","seo_description":"In the book of Genesis, we meet Jacob. Jacob was Isaac's son, and as we hear his story, we discover that Jacob was a person who struggled to trust God. When Jac","published_at":"2024-03-10T10:00:02-05:00"}]$seed$::jsonb) e, jsonb_populate_record(null::sermons, e) r
on conflict (slug) do update set title = excluded.title, description = excluded.description, scripture_references = excluded.scripture_references, topics = excluded.topics, service_type = excluded.service_type, audio_url = excluded.audio_url, youtube_url = excluded.youtube_url, video_url = excluded.video_url, thumbnail_url = excluded.thumbnail_url, preached_at = excluded.preached_at, location = excluded.location, seo_description = excluded.seo_description, published_at = excluded.published_at, speaker_id = excluded.speaker_id, series_id = excluded.series_id;

