es","typical_time":"6:30 pm","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","venue":"Cafe","featured_image_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/PLUG-Square-NOV.jpg","churchsuite_form_url":null,"external_url":null,"seo_description":"Love LEGO? Come build, create, and connect with fellow brick enthusiasts of all ages at P.L.U.G – Palatine Lego Users Group! Thrive Vineyard Church: Cafe, 845 E","published_at":"2025-10-09 20:38:43+00:00"},{"slug":"youth-alpha","name":"TYG YOUTH ALPHA","description":"Come hang out, eat some great food, and have real conversations about life, faith, and meaning at Youth Alpha. No pressure. No judgment. Just a space to ask questions, share your thoughts, and explore what you believe.\r\nBring your friends, bring your questions, and find some answers.\r\n\r\nComing to Thrive on January 8th and 22nd, from 6:30-8:00PM. For more information, contact David at david.rak24@gmail.com","short_summary":"Come hang out, eat some great food, and have real conversations about life, faith, and meaning at Youth Alpha. No pressure. No judgment. Just a space to ask questions, share your thoughts, and explore","category":"Small Group","recurrence_description":"Every other Thursday","typical_time":"6:30 pm","location":null,"venue":null,"featured_image_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/AY_Ripped_2.avif","churchsuite_form_url":null,"external_url":null,"seo_description":"Come hang out, eat some great food, and have real conversations about life, faith, and meaning at Youth Alpha. No pressure. No judgment. Just a space to ask que","published_at":"2025-08-24 18:17:26+00:00"},{"slug":"summer-baptisms-2025","name":"Summer Baptisms 2025","description":"Baptism Sunday - August 31\r\nBaptism is one of the most beautiful ways we get to say “yes” to Jesus!\n\n\r\nAt Thrive Vineyard, we believe baptism is a public celebration of a personal decision – an outward expression of the inward transformation Jesus has done in our lives. It’s a moment where we invite the Holy Spirit to meet us in a powerful way as we follow Jesus into a new season of life with Him.\n\n\r\nWhether you’ve been following Jesus for years or you’re just beginning to explore what faith looks like, we’d love to walk with you through this next step.\n\n\r\n\r\nBaptism Classes\r\nIf you’re interested in being baptized, join us for one of our baptism classes to learn more about what baptism is all about and what to expect:\n\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \t\r\nSunday, August 17 – 9:00 AM\u00a0\n\n\r\n\r\n \t\r\nSunday, August 24 – 9:00 AM\n\n\r\n\r\n\r\nClasses will be held in the Nest, before service for the two Sundays leading up to our baptism service.\r\nBaptism Sunday\r\nOur baptism celebration will take place during the 9:30 AM service on Sunday, August 31.Bring your family and friends – this is a church‑wide celebration!\n\n\r\n\r\nReady to take the next step?\r\nIf you’re ready to be baptized or have questions, fill out the form below, email carley@thrivevineyard.com or talk to us at one of the baptism classes. We can’t wait to celebrate what God is doing in your life!\n\n\r\n\n\r\n\n\r\n\r\nLooking for another event?\r\nCheck out our other events and happenings here!\n\n\r\nWatch our services and more on our YouTube","short_summary":"Baptism Sunday - August 31 Baptism is one of the most beautiful ways we get to say “yes” to Jesus! At Thrive Vineyard, we believe baptism is a public celebration of a personal decision – an outward ex","category":null,"recurrence_description":"Sundays","typical_time":"9:00 am","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","venue":"Cafe","featured_image_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Summer-Baptism-Square-2025.jpg","churchsuite_form_url":null,"external_url":null,"seo_description":"Baptism Sunday - August 31 Baptism is one of the most beautiful ways we get to say “yes” to Jesus! At Thrive Vineyard, we believe baptism is a public celebratio","published_at":"2025-07-28 16:57:54+00:00"},{"slug":"what-makes-you-beautiful-thrive-girls-group","name":"What Makes You Beautiful: Thrive Girls Group","description":"🌸 New 10-Week Devotional Study for Girls (Ages 9–12) 🌸\r\nHelp your daughter discover her true beauty in God’s image! All girls welcome—come grow in grace and beauty together! 🌷\r\n\r\nStarts June 22\u00a0| Sundays, 11:30 AM–12:30 PM\r\n\r\nLed by:\u00a0Mandy Chandler | 📧\u00a0mandy.m.chandler@gmail.com\r\n\r\nWeekly devotionals with Scripture, poetry & prayer\r\n\r\nBuilds confidence, faith & Christ-centered identity","short_summary":"🌸 New 10-Week Devotional Study for Girls (Ages 9–12) 🌸 Help your daughter discover her true beauty in God’s image! All girls welcome—come grow in grace and beauty together! 🌷 Starts June 22 | Sundays,","category":"Kid's Ministry","recurrence_description":"Sundays","typical_time":"11:30 am","location":null,"venue":null,"featured_image_url":null,"churchsuite_form_url":null,"external_url":null,"seo_description":"🌸 New 10-Week Devotional Study for Girls (Ages 9–12) 🌸 Help your daughter discover her true beauty in God’s image! All girls welcome—come grow in grace and beau","published_at":"2025-06-18 23:50:30+00:00"},{"slug":"kingdom-builders-2025","name":"Kingdom Builders 2025","description":"Kingdom Builders VBS 2025\r\nHosted by Thrive Vineyard Church – Palatine\r\n\r\nGet ready for a summer your kids won’t forget! Each Sunday in July,\u00a0Thrive Kids\u00a0invites your little adventurers to dive into fun, faith, and hands-on activities—from\u00a0water games and castle building\u00a0to\u00a0team battles\u00a0and\u00a0silly fishing for prizes.\r\n\r\nParents, enjoy a FREE coffee bar drink\u00a0while your kids experience themed adventures designed to inspire, engage, and entertain.\r\n\r\nSundays, July 6–27 | 9:30–11:00 AM\r\nThrive Vineyard Church 845 E. Glencoe Street Palatine Illinois 60074\r\n\r\nWeekly Themes:\r\nJuly 6 – Be Refreshed:\u00a0Water party fun (bring a change of clothes!)\r\nJuly 13 – Build Your House on the 