ur\u00a0VIP\u00a0and join us for this unforgettable day at\u00a0Thrive Vineyard Church.\r\n8:30 or 9:30 am\r\nVIP\u00a0check-in 15 minutes before both services.","short_summary":"VIP Sunday – A Day to Honor Someone Special! On Sunday Nov. 2 we’re celebrating the people who’ve made a difference in our lives! This is the perfect Sunday to bring someone who doesn’t usually come t","category":"Community Event","start_datetime":"2025-11-02T09:15:00-06:00","end_datetime":"2025-11-02T11:00:00-06:00","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","venue":"Sanctuary","featured_image_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/VIP-Square.jpg","churchsuite_form_url":null,"external_url":null,"seo_description":"VIP Sunday – A Day to Honor Someone Special! On Sunday Nov. 2 we’re celebrating the people who’ve made a difference in our lives! This is the perfect Sunday to ","published_at":"2025-10-16 03:52:59+00:00"},{"slug":"more-womens-conference-evanston-vineyard","name":"MORE Women’s Conference (Evanston Vineyard)","description":"Come and join hundreds of women who dare to believe that God has more for their churches, their cities, and their own lives.\n\nThis conference is for women who lead in the Vineyard — in any capacity: volunteer, small group leader, associate pastor, or lead pastor.\n\nExpect dynamic worship, inspiring teaching, and opportunities for connection with Vineyard women from across the region.\n\nInfants are welcome to attend with their mother, but childcare will not be provided.\n\n📅 Dates: Oct 2 – 4📍 Location: Evanston Vineyard Church, 2495 W. Howard St., Evanston IL 60202🔗 Register: events.humanitix.com/more-women-s-association-conference","short_summary":"Come and join hundreds of women who dare to believe that God has more for their churches, their cities, and their own lives. This conference is for women who lead in the Vineyard — in any capacity: vo","category":"Community Event","start_datetime":"2025-10-02T08:00:00-05:00","end_datetime":"2025-10-0