 before the All-Class Reunion Game!\n\nJoin Thrive as we share the love of Jesus and connect with our city by offering free PHS Pirate swag, prayer, and encouragement to alumni, students, and friends before the big game.\n\nLet’s show up, celebrate, and bless our community together!\n\n📍 Where: Palatine High School Parking Lot🕕 When: Friday, September 19, 5:30–7:00 PM📧 Contact: carley@thrivevineyard.com","short_summary":"Palatine High School Homecoming Outreach 🎉 Celebrate 150 years of Palatine High School before the All-Class Reunion Game! Join Thrive as we share the love of Jesus and connect with our city by offerin","category":"Community Event","start_datetime":"2025-09-19T17:30:00-05:00","end_datetime":"2025-09-19T19:00:00-05:00","location":"Thrive Vineyard lawn","venue":null,"featured_image_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Palatine-HS-Slide.jpg","churchsuite_form_url":null,"external_url":null,"seo_description":"Palatine High School Homecoming Outreach 🎉 Celebrate 150 years of Palatine High School before the All-Class Reunion Game! Join Thrive as we share the love of Je","published_at":"2025-10-07 00:12:02+00:00"},{"slug":"holy-spirit-come","name":"Holy Spirit Come","description":"Come encounter God’s presence in a powerful way!\n\n\r\nWhether you need fresh hope, breakthrough, or simply want to draw near to God, this evening is a space to be refreshed and filled by His Spirit.\n\n\r\nExpect worship, prayer, and ministry in an atmosphere of freedom and expectancy.\n\n\r\n📍 Where: Kiefer's Living Room, Palatine IL (email for details)\u00a0🕖 When: Wednesday July 15th 7-8:30pm📧 Contact: Molly@thrivevineyard.com","short_summary":"Come encounter God’s presence in a powerful way! Whether you need fresh hope, breakthrough, or simply want to draw near to God, this evening is a space to be refreshed and filled by His Spirit. Expect","category":"Community Event","start_datetime":"2026-07-15T19:00:00-05:00","end_datetime":"2026-07-15T20:30:00-05:00","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","venue":"Sanctuary","featured_image_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Holy-Spirit-Come-Square-6_17.jpg","churchsuite_form_url":null,"external_url":null,"seo_description":"Come encounter God’s presence in a powerful way! Whether you need fresh hope, breakthrough, or simply want to draw near to God, this evening is a space to be re","published_at":"2025-10-07 00:10:01+00:00"},{"slug":"fuel-the-fire-palatine-prayer-walk","name":"Fuel the Fire: Palatine Prayer Walk","description":"Fuel the Fire: Palatine Prayer Walk!\n\n\r\nAll fall long, join Thrive in covering our community in prayer!\n\n\r\nHow to Participate:• Take a prayer walk in your neighborhood or around Palatine.• Stop by Thrive’s Café to mark your walk on our Prayer Map—let’s see how much of Palatine we can cover together!• Use Thrive’s provided prayer points (or your own!) to lift up our city, neighbors, and community needs.• Share what God is doing! Send your praise reports, testimonies, and prophetic words to Julie or Wendy—we want to celebrate and encourage one another as God moves through our prayers.\n\n\r\nLet’s fuel the fire together and believe for transformation in Palatine! 🔥\n\n\r\n📧 jetrek@gmail.com | wendywasilewski2@gmail.com","short_summary":"Fuel the Fire: Palatine Prayer Walk! All fall long, join Thrive in covering our community in prayer! How to Participate:• Take a prayer walk in your neighborhood or around Palatine.• Stop by Thrive’s ","category":"Community Event","start_datetime":"2025-09-01T08:00:00-05:00","end_datetime":"2025-12-01T18:00:00-06:00","location":null,"venue":null,"featured_image_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Fuel-The-Fire-Walk-Square-scaled.jpg","churchsuite_form_url":null,"external_url":null,"seo_description":"Fuel the Fire: Palatine Prayer Walk! All fall long, join Thrive in covering our community in prayer! How to Participate:• Take a prayer walk in your neighborhoo","published_at":"2025-10-07 00:03:52+00:00"},{"slug":"thrive-revive-in-25","name":"Thrive Revive in '25","description":"Thrive Revive in ’25 — Let’s Build for the Next Generation (and Enjoy More Coffee Together ☕)\n\n\r\nThrive family, we’ve got exciting news to share! Someone in our church has generously given a $10,000 matching grant to help us revitalize two important areas of our church life: our Children’s Ministry area and our Café space.\n\n\r\nHere’s why this matters:• Our Children’s Ministry currently lacks walls, making it noisy and distracting. We want to create a beautiful, fresh, quiet environment where kids can encounter God’s love.• Our Café has become one of Thrive’s best connection points but is running out of room! We’ll expand seating and update the look to reflect Thrive’s warm, welcoming culture.\n\n\r\nEvery dollar you give will be doubled up to $10,000 — meaning we can raise $20,000 total!\n\n\r\nThis isn’t just about paint and walls—it’s about building spaces where kids grow in faith and friendships flourish.\n\n\r\nGive via: Zelle address: give@thrivevineyard.com — include “Thrive Revive” in the memo, or give by check.\n\n\r\nWith gratitude and excitement,Kevin","short_summary":"Thrive Revive in ’25 — Let’s Build for the Next Generation (and Enjoy More Coffee Together ☕) Thrive family, we’ve got exciting news to share! Someone in our church has generously given a $10,000 matc","category":"Community Event","start_datetime":"2025-09-28T08:00:00-05:00","end_datetime":"2025-10-31T18:00:00-05:00","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","venue":"Sanctuary","featured_image_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Thrive-Revive-In-25-Square.jpg","churchsuite_form_url":null,"external_url":null,"seo_description":"Thrive Revive in ’25 — Let’s Build for the Next Generation (and Enjoy More Coffee Together ☕) Thrive family, we’ve got exciting news to share! Someone in our ch","published_at":"2025-10-06 23:59:43+00:00"},{"slug":"school-of-kingdom-ministry","name":"School of Kingdom Ministry","description":"Join us for the School of Kingdom Ministry at Thrive!","short_summary":"Join us for the School of Kingdom Ministry at Thrive!","category":"Small Group","start_datetime":"2025-09-22T08:00:00-05:00","end_datetime":"2025-09-22T18:00:00-05:00","location":null,"venue":null,"featured_image_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/SOKM-announcement-slide.jpg","churchsuite_form_url":null,"external_url":null,"seo_description":"Join us for the School of Kingdom Ministry at Thrive!","published_at":"2025-08-24 18:21:20+00:00"},{"slug":"school-of-kingdom-ministry-info-meeting","name":"School of Kingdom Ministry Info Meeting","description":"Info Meeting & Lunch: Sunday, August 17th after 9:30 service\r\n\r\nClass Starts: September 22nd!\r\n\r\nRSVP Lunch/Questions: Email Carley\u00a0carley@thrivevineyard.com","short_summary":"Info Meeting & Lunch: Sunday, August 17th after 9:30 service Class Starts: September 22nd! RSVP Lunch/Questions: Email Carley carley@thrivevineyard.com","category":"Small Group","start_datetime":"2025-08-17T10:30:00-05:00","end_datetime":"2025-08-17T11:00:00-05:00","location":"Thrive Vineyard Church","venue":"Cafe","featured_image_url":"https://thrivevineyard.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/SOKM-announcement-slide.jpg","churchsuite_form_url":null,"external_url":null,"seo_description":"Info Meeting & Lunch: Sunday, August 17th after 9:30 service Class Starts: September 22nd! RSVP Lunch/Questions: Email Carley carley@thrivevineyard.com","published_at":"2025-08-06 04:36:03+00:00"},{"slug":"party-on-the-lawn","name":"Party on the Lawn","description":"5th Sunday: Life Together on the Lawn!\r\nJoin us for a special Sunday of\u00a0stories, laughter, and community—just like Jesus did!\r\n\r\nThis Sunday\r\nTestimonies of God’s faithfulness\r\nBags tournament\r\n\r\nPotluck Guide (by last name):\r\n\r\nA–H: Desserts\r\n\r\nI–Q: Salads/Fruit\r\n\r\nR–Z: Main Dish (wraps, sandwiches, etc.)\r\n\